    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">1 Schedule for the admission procedure.</h2>
    <p>The study program "<span data-field="program_name">{{ program_name }} Online"</span> offers admission processes for various dates.</p>
    <p>After each admission date, we offer study places to those applicants, whose results are above average. Thus, the earlier you participate in one of our admission procedures, the earlier you can secure your study place. We also recommend applicants from non-EU countries to apply early (Date 1), as their admission process (e.g. legalization of documents) can take longer.</p>

