    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">2 Online Application.</h2>
    <p>Please submit your application online: <a href="https://tasks.mci.edu/index.php?option=com_onlinebewertung&view=register&lang=en" data-field="application_link_1">{{ application_link_1 }}</a> and make sure to include all relevant documents listed on the guideline for applications: <a href="https://tasks.mci.edu/components/com_onlinebewertung/assets/leitfaden-go.pdf" data-field="application_link_2">{{ application_link_2 }}</a>.</p>
    <p>For further information concerning the legalization of the documents please visit the MCI website: <a href="https://www.mci.edu/study/application-and-admission/international-applicants" data-field="application_link_3">{{ application_link_3 }}</a>.</p>

