    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">4 Interview.</h2>
    <p>After the successful completion of the online examination, we will invite you to an interview that will take about 20 minutes. In the interview, you have the opportunity to introduce yourself in front of a panel and explain your study and career aspirations.</p>
    <p>There are two ways to take the interview:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>via personal interview: The interview will be held at the MCI in Innsbruck.</li>
        <li>via Skype: The interview will be held via Skype. You have to make sure that <span data-field="skype_requirement_1">{{ skype_requirement_1 }}</span></li>
        <li>You have a unique profile on Skype that can be easily identified with the username/email address.</li>
        <li>You have got a properly functioning webcam.</li>
        <li>You have a stable internet connection; if that cannot be ensured at home, you are advised to go to a university, library or another public place where this condition is given.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>However, we advise everybody who can come to the MCI to take the chance of a personal interview.</p>

